{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_Section_Logo.png?t=1749199820\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_Section_Banner.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Welcome to The Six, a magical world where dice define your identity. You\u2019re an adventurer trapped in a timeloop with a chaotic, impish DM. Beneath the surface, a dungeon morphs and shifts every day, hiding secrets and relics that will be the key to your escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Beneath The Six is a rogue-like experience with a single randomised daily dungeon and 4-player co-op. Collect sets of dice and use them to create and blend fighters, mages or rogues to beat the DM\u2019s daily challenges. Earn rewards to unlock more dice sets, build your collection by trading with friends and, one day, perhaps, escape The Six.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_CollectDice.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Collect Dice</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Unpack and collect beautiful sets of mystical dice from a pool of 135 sets. Purchase sets from our store or unbox random ones from dice chests. Hunt down the rarest dice, including 12 legendary sets!</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_BuildYourCharacter.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Unique Character Creator</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Use your dice sets to create a near-infinite range of characters with differing skills, armours, weapons and stats to take on the dungeon. Each individual dice in a set provides a specific component to your character so you can mix and match them how you see fit.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_Explore.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Procedural Daily Dungeon</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> Beneath The Six\u2019s Daily Dungeon regenerates every 24 hours with new challenges, monsters, secrets and loot, and different dungeons will suit different characters. Your challenge: find the right build for today\u2019s adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_Arena.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Survive The Daily Arena</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> Beneath The Six features a brutal Arena mode, where each wave gets increasingly difficult, with higher tiered enemies and near-impossible intensity. The Arena resets itself every 24 hours. Compete with your friends for the top spot on the leaderboard!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_Multiplayer.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Party Up and Explore With Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Beneath The Six supports 4-player co-op, allowing you to tackle the dangers of the dungeon and arena with backup, and show off your new characters.</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/About_Challenges.png?t=1749199820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Endure Daily Challenges</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Complete weekly and daily challenges in the dungeons to earn rewards which will allow you to unlock more dice sets.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <